  "sourceRequirements": {
    "summary": "Research papers use the IMRaD structure with a structured abstract and a what-this-adds summary.\n\nDistilled requirements: Body up to 3,000 words; abstract up to 250 words; up to 5 figures; up to 4 tables; up to 50 references; required sections: Introduction, Methods, Results, Discussion; Vancouver citation style.\n\nAlso required: Structured abstract: Objectives, Design, Setting, Participants, Main outcome measures, Results, Conclusions; What is already known / What this study adds box required; Patient and public involvement statement required.\n\nThis summary is the app's distillation \u2014 open the author instructions above to confirm against the journal's current text.",
